            <note corresp="#d376-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d376-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Reagan Library, System IV Intelligence Files, 1984, 400819. Secret. Sent
                    for action.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d376-f2" n="2" xml:id="d376-f2-content">
                <p>Reference is to the Democratic Presidential and Vice Presidential candidates,
                    Walter Mondale and Geraldine Ferraro, respectively.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d376-f3" n="3" xml:id="d376-f3-content">
                <p>McFarlane initialed the “Approve”
                    option.</p>
            </note>
